CLASS zcl_gogen_t_dynrecvany DEFINITION PUBLIC FINAL CREATE PUBLIC.
 PUBLIC SECTION. CLASS-METHODS run RETURNING VALUE(rv) TYPE string.
ENDCLASS.
CLASS zcl_gogen_t_dynrecvany IMPLEMENTATION.
 METHOD run.
 DATA x TYPE i. FIELD-SYMBOLS <g> TYPE any. ASSIGN x TO <g>.
 CALL METHOD ('ZCL_GOGEN_T_DYNRECV')=>('NUM') RECEIVING result = <g>.
 rv = |{ x }|.
 ENDMETHOD.
ENDCLASS.
